  "animationImplementation": "Original full-detail rig preserved. Original procedural skeletal gait implemented in src/guardian.js, driven by displacement. No downloaded motion capture clips.",
  "modifications": [
    "Converted original Pok.fbx to GLB using Three.js FBXLoader and GLTFExporter.",
    "Removed unused speech viseme morph targets to reduce bundled memory and file size; preserved 31,998 triangles and 29-bone skin.",
    "Original stone image files copied unchanged and renamed for portable asset URLs.",
    "Runtime materials rebuilt as MeshStandardMaterial with separate color, normal, roughness and occlusion maps; carved sculpture surfaces use the original photographic Rough_Rock_023 color and roughness maps while preserving the dedicated baked carving normal and occlusion maps. Stone colors adjusted to cool weathered gray for the dungeon.",
    "Runtime arms lowered from T-pose, original rig animated with an original procedural walking cycle; feet grounded and model normalized to 2.25m high."
  ],
